      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_019_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "320万美金的base加上股票，这数字在中国能买好几套学区房了。",
      "start": 185.166,
      "duration": 5.834,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_020_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "真的假的？但重点还不是这个数字，是他们要招的销售干嘛用的。",
      "start": 191.412,
      "duration": 6.356,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_021_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你说到点子上了。这岗位的核心任务是服务Meta这种超级客户。说白了，就是大客户战略。",
      "start": 198.247,
      "duration": 6.487,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_022_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这事儿你说奇不奇怪？Anthropic跟OpenAI打生打死，结果转头还得伺候Meta这个潜在的对手？",
      "start": 205.166,
      "duration": 8.707,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_023_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这就是AI行业最拧巴的地方。我跟你讲，企业级AI市场现在就是这种\"竞合\"状态。Meta自己也在做大模型，Anthropic跟它是竞争关系；但Meta又愿意花钱买Anthropic的服务，因为它暂时还没把自己的模型做到能完全替代外部供应的程度。",
      "start": 214.341,
      "duration": 19.002,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_024_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "所以等Meta自研模型成熟了，会不会一脚把Anthropic踹了？",
      "start": 233.833,
      "duration": 5.137,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_025_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这是必然的。所以Anthropic现在高薪挖人，本质上是在抢时间窗口。在Meta觉醒之前，把客户关系做到牢不可破，把工作流嵌入得足够深，让对方哪怕有替代方案也懒得换。",
      "start": 239.447,
      "duration": 13.08,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_026_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我突然有种看宫斗剧的感觉，你方唱罢我登场，谁也不知道谁是最后的盟友。",
      "start": 252.945,
      "duration": 7.271,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_027_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你这形容挺有意思。但说真的，这种格局对客户来说其实挺不利的。你的供应商一边给你提供服务，一边在提防你，因为你既是金主也可能是明天的竞争对手。",
      "start": 260.655,
      "duration": 11.146,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_028_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那这种关系会不会催生一种新的商业模式？比如搞个排他条款什么的。",
      "start": 272.213,
      "duration": 6.139,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_029_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "短期内不会。大模型迭代速度太快，任何长期排他协议都不划算。但未来可能会出现一种\"中立云\"模式，由第三方公司来撮合，让AI公司和它的潜在对手在数据隔离的前提下做生意。",
      "start": 278.845,
      "duration": 14.866,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_030_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "听起来有点像瑞士的中立国。",
      "start": 294.12,
      "duration": 3.091,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_031_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你这比喻挺形象的。好了，大新闻聊完了，咱们来看看几条有意思的快讯。",
      "start": 297.698,
      "duration": 5.268,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_032_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "对，第一条，Moonshot AI，就是Kimi的母公司，目标年营收20亿美元了。",
      "start": 303.408,
      "duration": 7.619,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_033_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "20亿美元啊，这数字在国内AI公司里算是相当激进的。而且你注意，他们还提到K3模型日均处理3000亿tokens。",
      "start": 311.487,
      "duration": 10.362,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_034_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "3000亿？这个量级听着有点吓人。具体是什么概念呢？",
      "start": 322.32,
      "duration": 4.876,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_035_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这么跟你说吧，一个普通用户跟ChatGPT聊一整天，可能也就消耗个几万tokens。3000亿意味着Moonshot的算力调度能力已经进入了第一世界的水平。",
      "start": 327.608,
      "duration": 11.905,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_036_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那他们主要靠什么赚钱呢？C端订阅还是企业服务？",
      "start": 339.958,
      "duration": 5.094,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_037_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "大概率是企业服务占大头。C端订阅有天花板，国内用户的付费意愿再怎么挖掘也很难撑起20亿美元。所以他们肯定是在做垂直行业方案，比如金融、教育、法律这些场景。",
      "start": 345.507,
      "duration": 13.559,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_038_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "好的，第二条快讯，Google DeepMind推出了Gemini驱动的ATL Saathi，给印度机器人实验室的教师当助手。",
      "start": 359.506,
      "duration": 8.707,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_039_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这名字ATL Saathi挺有意思的，Saathi在印地语里就是\"伙伴\"的意思。你看，DeepMind连起名字都在做本地化运营。",
      "start": 368.691,
      "duration": 10.188,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_040_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "是给老师用的AI伙伴？",
      "start": 379.36,
      "duration": 2.003,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_041_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，专门辅助机器人实验课程的老师。你知道印度现在STEM教育推得很猛，机器人实验室雨后春笋一样冒出来，但合格的教师严重不够。所以这种AI助手就承担了一部分答疑、指导、个性化辅导的工作。",
      "start": 381.789,
      "duration": 16.563,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_042_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我跟你说，这种应用场景特别有意义。比那些卷参数、刷榜的新闻接地气多了。",
      "start": 398.822,
      "duration": 8.011,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_043_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "完全同意。而且它选印度不是偶然的，人口基数大、教育需求迫切、政府支持力度够，是天然的AI教育试验场。",
      "start": 407.294,
      "duration": 8.62,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_044_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "第三条快讯，Apple的ML Research发布了一个叫SimpleDesign的东西。",
      "start": 416.37,
      "duration": 5.616,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_045_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这个有意思。它是联合建模蛋白质序列和三维结构的，目标是加速AI for Science的落地。",
      "start": 422.452,
      "duration": 7.488,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_046_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "AI for Science这个词最近听着挺频繁的。具体到这个SimpleDesign，它难在哪？",
      "start": 430.373,
      "duration": 6.444,
      "audios": {
        "lively": "chunk_047_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你注意啊，传统方法要么是先预测序列再折叠结构，要么是先有结构再反推序列，两步走容易累积误差。SimpleDesign想做的事情是端到端联合建模，让序列和结构在生成过程中互相约束。",
      "start": 437.224,
      "duration": 18.915,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_048_professional.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这种技术对普通人有啥影响？听着很高深的样子。",
      "start": 456.609,
      "duration": 4.31,
      "audios": {
